<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<odoo>
<template id="report_non_managerial_different">
     <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
                <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                    <div class="page">
                        <div class="row mt32">
                            <div class="col-8">

                            </div>
                            <div class="col-4" style="float:left;">
                                 <strong>Date.:</strong>
                                <span t-esc="datetime.date.today()"/>
                                <br/>
                                  <strong>Ref. No.</strong>
									<span t-field="o.app_reference"/>
                                  <br/>
                                <strong>ID.No.:</strong>
                                 <span t-field="o.employee_number"/>
                                <br/>
                                  <br/>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                         <div class="row mt32">
                              <div class="col-12">
                                <strong><span t-field="o.partner_name"/></strong>
                                <br/>
                                <strong>Dear <span t-field="o.partner_name"/>,</strong>
								
                            </div>
                             </div>
                        <h6 class="text-center"><strong><u>Subject: - Promotion</u></strong></h6>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Considering your experience and remarkable contribution to the Bank, I am pleased to inform you that you are promoted to the post of <strong><span t-field="o.job_id"/></strong> (Job Grade <strong><span t-field="o.job_grade_id"/></strong>) and assigned at <strong><span t-field="o.final_work_unit"/></strong> effective <strong><span t-field="o.promotion_date"/>.</strong></p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Commencing the same date, your monthly gross salary is raised to  <strong>Birr <span t-field="o.job_grade_id.base_salary"/></strong>  and you are entitled to other benefits attached to the positon as per the benefit Package.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>By copy of this letter, <strong><span t-field="o.employee_work_unit"/></strong> is advised to release <strong><span t-field="o.partner_name"/></strong> and forward Leave status and any other necessary information to <strong><span t-field="o.final_work_unit"/> and Talent Management Directorate.</strong></p>
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        <p>We hope you will continue to exert maximum effort to discharge the duties and responsibilities bestowed upon you. </p>
                        <br/>
                    </div>
                <div>
                               <div class="row mt32">
                                   <br/>
                             <div class="col-6">
                                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                                 <br/>
                                 <br/>


                                 <strong>CC:</strong>
								 <t t-foreach="o.cc_workunits" t-as="related_record">
                                    <li><t t-esc="related_record.name"/></li>
                                    <!-- Add more fields as needed -->
                                </t>
                                 <!-- <span t-field="o.operating_unit_tag" /> -->
                                  <br/>

<!--                                <span t-field="o.resignation_type" />-->
                                  <br/>
                             </div>

                        </div>

                </div>

                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
</template>
</odoo>